      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That doesn't sound right. I thought APA 7th was supposed to use \"et al.\" for three or more authors right away? I'm looking at my guidelines and it says something different about the in-text part. Can you double check that for me? Also, how does the Chicago one handle it if I'm citing them for the first time in the paper?",
